    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·9月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></span></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"8a4c30cf238bc1841201626f409779b0\" title=\"9月前瞻.png\" alt=\"9月前瞻.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20240718/8a4c30cf238bc1841201626f409779b0.png\"/></div><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·讲述者列表</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"759ee903b0a2b592a1060bed4ad4376b\" title=\"9月月小队.png\" alt=\"9月月小队.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20240718/759ee903b0a2b592a1060bed4ad4376b.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>奇遇讲述者锡人</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在回归途中，锡人被梅兰德基金会的同事拦住了。</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·假说辑录</strong></span></span></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"f154695b68df16c515ea006f02ff9999\" title=\"9月奖励.png\" alt=\"9月奖励.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20240718/f154695b68df16c515ea006f02ff9999.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">假说辑录的等级上限提升至</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">80</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>9月稀有奖励界面主题 词祭</strong></span><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">思维创造的祭品，必将由言语奉上。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><br/><strong><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">9月稀有奖励魂灵印象家具收藏包一</span><br/></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">讲述者们一旦从故事中脱身，就再难清楚记起其中的器物纹饰。他们曾造访的无数座卡兹戴尔只剩下空洞的印象，被“如尘的愁绪”和“无端的异兆”填补。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·本月委托栏</strong></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
